---
title: Swiss potato salad
servings: 4
---

= Vinaigrette =
In a medium bowl, combine @Swiss Kressi Vinegar{3%tbsp}, @olive oil{3%tbsp}, @Swiss Thomy mustard{1%tsp}, @Maggi liquid seasoning{1%tsp}, @onion{1/2}(finely chopped), @salt{to taste}, @pepper{to taste} and @Aromat{to taste}.

= Salad =

> For best results, boil the evening before and store in fridge

Boil @potatoes{4}(skin on) in a large pot for 20 to 30 minutes.


Peel potatoes the next morning. Slice potatoes and put in a big bowl. Add @beef bouillon{1/4%cup}(warm). Mix and add the vinaigrette.